{"quest_id": 8126, "name": "三白荘の殺人　事件編", "description": "紅牡丹一座による新春公演！\n淡雪降る山荘の宴に参加する一同へ\n予定外の客が食材を奪おうと襲い来る……。\n中級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv1 出撃8体）", "event": "ゴールドラッシュ32(2023)", "event_category": "Reproduce", "mission_id": 300416, "map_no": 4822, "level": 100, "multiplier": 1.0, "charisma": 25, "capacity": 8, "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["置物", "ステルスII", "ブロック不可"], "fixture": true, "hp": 100000, "base_hp": 100000, "damage_type": "physical", "attack_speed": 1, "attack_wait": 30, "attack_interval": 122, "move_speed": 400.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2141472, "race_id": 4, "master_id": 36806, "global_id": 10423}, {"enemy_id": 2, "source": "local", "count": 2, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["置物", "ステルスII", "ブロック不可"], "fixture": true, "hp": 100000, "attack": 1, "base_hp": 100000, "base_attack": 1, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 350, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_speed": 1, "attack_wait": 60, "attack_interval": 154, "move_speed": 600.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1, "pattern_id": 2149280, "race_id": 4, "master_id": 36800, "global_id": 10417}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 2, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["置物", "ステルスII", "ブロック不可"], "fixture": true, "hp": 100000, "attack": 1, "base_hp": 100000, "base_attack": 1, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 350, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_speed": 1, "attack_wait": 60, "attack_interval": 194, "move_speed": 600.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1, "pattern_id": 2149296, "race_id": 16, "master_id": 36801, "global_id": 10418}, {"enemy_id": 4, "source": "local", "count": 2, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["置物", "ステルスII", "ブロック不可"], "fixture": true, "hp": 100000, "attack": 1, "base_hp": 100000, "base_attack": 1, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 350, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_speed": 1, "attack_wait": 60, "attack_interval": 137, "move_speed": 600.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1, "pattern_id": 2149328, "race_id": 16, "master_id": 36803, "global_id": 10420}, {"enemy_id": 5, "source": "local", "count": 2, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["置物", "ステルスII", "ブロック不可"], "fixture": true, "hp": 100000, "attack": 1, "base_hp": 100000, "base_attack": 1, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 350, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_speed": 1, "attack_wait": 60, "attack_interval": 172, "move_speed": 600.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1, "pattern_id": 2149312, "race_id": 16, "master_id": 36802, "global_id": 10419}, {"enemy_id": 6, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["置物", "ステルスII", "ブロック不可"], "fixture": true, "hp": 100000, "attack": 1, "base_hp": 100000, "base_attack": 1, "damage_type": "magical", "armor_defense": 350, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_speed": 1, "attack_wait": 60, "attack_interval": 192, "move_speed": 350.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1, "pattern_id": 2149440, "race_id": 16, "master_id": 36805, "global_id": 10422}, {"enemy_id": 7, "source": "local", "count": 8, "form_count": 1, "hp": 640, "attack": 140, "base_hp": 640, "base_attack": 140, "damage_type": "physical", "attack_speed": 40, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 101, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.25, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097200, "race_id": 9, "master_id": 3, "spawn_sec": 3}, {"enemy_id": 8, "source": "local", "count": 2, "form_count": 1, "hp": 640, "attack": 200, "base_hp": 640, "base_attack": 200, "damage_type": "physical", "attack_range": 140, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 60, "attack_interval": 171, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2999999523162842, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2098016, "race_id": 9, "missile_id": 9, "missile": {"speed": 3.0, "deflectable": true}, "master_id": 68, "global_id": 67, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 4}, {"enemy_id": 9, "source": "local", "count": 2, "form_count": 1, "hp": 900, "attack": 200, "base_hp": 900, "base_attack": 200, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "attack_speed": 60, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 153, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097360, "race_id": 9, "master_id": 16, "spawn_sec": 29}, {"enemy_id": 10, "source": "local", "count": 4, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["アーマー"], "hp": 720, "attack": 140, "base_hp": 720, "base_attack": 140, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 200, "attack_speed": 40, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 101, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.25, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2103216, "race_id": 9, "master_id": 262, "global_id": 261, "spawn_sec": 30}, {"enemy_id": 11, "source": "local", "count": 4, "form_count": 1, "hp": 1500, "attack": 150, "base_hp": 1500, "base_attack": 150, "damage_type": "physical", "attack_speed": 40, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 133, "move_speed": 800.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097664, "race_id": 9, "master_id": 37, "global_id": 36, "spawn_sec": 46}, {"enemy_id": 12, "source": "local", "count": 12, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["アーマー"], "hp": 1400, "attack": 150, "base_hp": 1400, "base_attack": 150, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 300, "attack_speed": 40, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 101, "move_speed": 800.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.25, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2103360, "race_id": 9, "master_id": 441, "global_id": 440, "spawn_sec": 47}, {"enemy_id": 13, "source": "local", "count": 4, "form_count": 1, "hp": 1000, "attack": 150, "base_hp": 1000, "base_attack": 150, "damage_type": "physical", "attack_speed": 40, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 101, "move_speed": 800.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2999999523162842, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097632, "race_id": 9, "master_id": 35, "global_id": 34, "spawn_sec": 48}, {"enemy_id": 14, "source": "local", "count": 7, "form_count": 2, "hp": 1300, "attack": 350, "base_hp": 1300, "base_attack": 350, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "attack_range": 160, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 45, "attack_interval": 141, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.399999976158142, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2098208, "race_id": 9, "change_to": 14, "missile_id": 9, "missile": {"speed": 3.0, "deflectable": true}, "master_id": 70, "global_id": 69, "ranged": true, "to_global_id": 533, "spawn_sec": 56}, {"enemy_id": 14, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 1, "form_count": 2, "hp": 1300, "attack": 350, "base_hp": 1300, "base_attack": 350, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 45, "attack_interval": 211, "move_speed": 700.0, "dot_rate": 1.399999976158142, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2098208, "race_id": 9, "change_to": 13, "missile_id": 9, "missile": {"speed": 3.0, "deflectable": true}, "master_id": 534, "global_id": 533}, {"enemy_id": 16, "source": "local", "count": 4, "form_count": 2, "hp": 1200, "attack": 250, "base_hp": 1200, "base_attack": 250, "damage_type": "magical", "armor_defense": 30, "attack_range": 140, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 60, "attack_interval": 191, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.399999976158142, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2098224, "race_id": 9, "change_to": 16, "missile_id": 7, "missile": {"speed": 6.0, "splash": 133}, "master_id": 71, "global_id": 70, "ranged": true, "to_global_id": 534, "spawn_sec": 74}, {"enemy_id": 16, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 1, "form_count": 2, "hp": 1200, "attack": 250, "base_hp": 1200, "base_attack": 250, "damage_type": "magical", "armor_defense": 30, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 60, "attack_interval": 261, "move_speed": 700.0, "dot_rate": 1.399999976158142, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2098224, "race_id": 9, "change_to": 15, "missile_id": 7, "missile": {"speed": 6.0, "splash": 133}, "master_id": 535, "global_id": 534}, {"enemy_id": 18, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["置物", "ステルスII", "ブロック不可"], "fixture": true, "hp": 100000, "attack": 1, "base_hp": 100000, "base_attack": 1, "damage_type": "magical", "armor_defense": 350, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_speed": 1, "attack_wait": 60, "attack_interval": 192, "move_speed": 350.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1, "pattern_id": 2149344, "race_id": 16, "master_id": 36804, "global_id": 10421, "spawn_sec": 118}, {"enemy_id": 19, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_count": 2, "tags": ["置物", "ステルスII"], "fixture": true, "hp": 57000, "base_hp": 57000, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 800, "magic_defense": 15, "attack_range": 60, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 10, "move_speed": 350.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1, "transform_resist": 1, "pattern_id": 2130272, "race_id": 16, "special_effect_id": 910, "change_to": 19, "missile_id": 643, "missile": {"speed": 3.0}, "master_id": 34285, "global_id": 7902, "ranged": true, "to_global_id": 7903, "spawn_sec": 120}, {"enemy_id": 19, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 1, "form_count": 2, "tags": ["置物", "ステルスII"], "fixture": true, "hp": 57000, "base_hp": 57000, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 800, "magic_defense": 15, "attack_range": 60, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 10, "move_speed": 350.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1, "pattern_id": 2130272, "race_id": 16, "special_effect_id": 265, "missile_id": 643, "missile": {"speed": 3.0}, "master_id": 34286, "global_id": 7903, "ranged": true}], "popups": ["\n\n\n　　　　　――ドサ……。", "\n\n\n　　　しばらく経った後……。"], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "紅牡丹", "text": "――淡雪降る山荘、宴のさなかに起こる殺人劇。\n４人の容疑者、そこに現れるは名探偵！", "face": "u661"}, {"name": "紅牡丹", "text": "紅牡丹一座、新春公演！\n『名探偵アナベラ　三白荘の殺人』\nはじまりはじまり～♪", "face": "u661"}]}, {"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "パラベル", "text": "はふはふっ……！\nん～っ、おいしいですの！　みんなで作ったお鍋！", "face": "u1922a1"}, {"name": "アヅミ", "text": "ふふっ、アヅミが吟味に吟味を重ねた食材たち――\nを旦那様に振舞った余りと、ここらで採れた山菜で作る、\n山姥風の寄せ鍋にございます。", "face": "u2024a1"}, {"name": "ノストラ", "text": "ふん、まあまあの味じゃない……あつっ……。\n食材を切ったのが私だものね……あづっ……。", "face": "u1912a1"}, {"name": "エリアス", "text": "ノストラさんは、猫舌なのですね。\nふーふーして食べるといいと思います。", "face": "u373"}, {"name": "パラベル", "text": "（まずマスクを取らせるべきだと思いますの。\nでも、そういうズレたとこもかわいい……）", "face": "u1922a1"}, {"name": "バルバストラフ", "text": "改めてようこそ、今は亡き友人から譲り受けた別荘へ。\nそして今日呼んだのは、わしが世話になっとる者たち。\nこんなじじいに新年から付き合うてくれて、感謝しとる。", "face": "u63"}, {"name": "ノストラ", "text": "あら、あなたに懐いた覚えなんてないわ。", "face": "u1912a1"}, {"name": "バルバストラフ", "text": "ならば、ぬしの善行については黙っておこうか。", "face": "u63"}, {"name": "バルバストラフ", "text": "それにしても、この歳で人に恵まれた。\n健康を気に掛けてくれる者、\n手料理の味見をさせてくれる者……", "face": "u63"}, {"name": "バルバストラフ", "text": "……これこれベルちゃんや、\n食事中に、わしの髭でちょうちょ結びを作るでない。", "face": "u63"}, {"name": "パラベル", "text": "きゃっきゃっ。", "face": "u1922a1"}, {"name": "バルバストラフ", "text": "ああ、幸せだ。\n皆もこの新年会、どうか楽しんでおくれ。", "face": "u63"}, {"name": "バルバストラフ", "text": "……きっと、これで最後なのだから。", "face": "u63"}, {"name": "エリアス", "text": "…………。", "face": "u373"}]}, {"trigger": "battle", "at_sec": 7, "lines": [{"name": "ゴブリン", "text": "ギャギャ！　オイシイオナベ！", "face": "l86d5a806e375"}, {"name": "ゴブリン", "text": "ギャギャ！　マルゴトイタダキ！", "face": "l86d5a806e375"}, {"name": "アヅミ", "text": "おや、予約のないお客様が。\n本日は生憎、満席にございます。", "face": "u2024a1"}, {"name": "バルバストラフ", "text": "奪うというなら、お帰り願おう。\nさあここはひとつ、わしが指揮を――", "face": "u63"}, {"name": "パラベル", "text": "ノストラちゃんはアヅミさんより前へ！\nベルは背後より援護しますの！\nエリアスちゃんは、三人の治癒役をしてほしいですの！", "face": "u1922a1"}, {"name": "パラベル", "text": "バルおじいちゃんは、\n離れた位置から補佐をお願いしますの！", "face": "u1922a1"}, {"name": "バルバストラフ", "text": "ふぉっふぉっふぉ、先を越されてしまったか。\nそれでは本年の戦初め――総員、戦闘開始じゃ。", "face": "u63"}]}, {"trigger": "battle", "at_sec": 77, "lines": [{"name": "ゴブリン", "text": "ギャギャ……ヤラレゾメ……。\nデモ、オナベノレシピ、アリガト……。", "face": "l86d5a806e375"}, {"name": "アヅミ", "text": "退却するゴブリンめらの一匹に、\n寄せ鍋の調理法を渡しておきました。\n彼らもまた、仲間と鍋を囲むことでしょう。", "face": "u2024a1"}, {"name": "バルバストラフ", "text": "ともあれこれで、一件落……着……。", "face": "u63"}]}, {"trigger": "battle", "at_sec": 117, "lines": [{"name": "パラベル", "text": "！？　バルおじいちゃんが、倒れた……？", "face": "u1922a1"}, {"name": "エリアス", "text": "私が診ます！　皆さんは、\n座布団を重ねて寝台を作ってください！", "face": "u373"}]}, {"trigger": "battle", "at_sec": 120, "lines": [{"name": "？？？", "text": "……いや、もう急ぐ必要はない。", "face": "u1309a1"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "ノストラ", "text": "あら、何者なの？　あなた。\nもっとも、その言葉には同意するわ。\n経験上分かるけれど――彼は、もう死体になった。", "face": "u1912a1"}, {"name": "アヅミ", "text": "まあ、なんてこと……。", "face": "u2024a1"}, {"name": "名探偵アナベラ", "text": "ぼくは名探偵アナベラ。騒ぎを聞いて駆け付けたんだ。\nこれより検死を行う――皆は、ここから動かないでくれ。", "face": "u1309a1"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "名探偵アナベラ", "text": "彼の死因が分かった――飲食に混ぜての毒殺だよ。", "face": "u1309a1"}, {"name": "パラベル", "text": "ど、毒！？　でもベルたちは、同じ鍋を食べて……。", "face": "u1922a1"}, {"name": "名探偵アナベラ", "text": "その通り。毒は、君たちがつついた\n寄せ鍋の中からも検出されたのさ。\n分かる者が居るかは知らないが、これが毒の成分だよ。", "face": "u1309a1"}, {"name": "エリアス", "text": "ひどい……。頑張って作った料理に、\n変なものを混ぜるだなんて。", "face": "u373"}, {"name": "エリアス", "text": "ですが、その毒のことは知っています。\n服毒後、しばらくの間は全くの無害な、遅効性の毒。\n治療を放棄すると、毒性の発揮後、即死するといいます。", "face": "u373"}, {"name": "ノストラ", "text": "人呼んで、『懺悔室の雪』。\nほとんど苦痛なく死に至ることから、\n一部の国では安楽死や――処刑にも使われているわ。", "face": "u1912a1"}, {"name": "ノストラ", "text": "闇ギルドに居たときでさえ、噂にしか聞かない物騒な毒。\n随分お詳しいのね、帝国の生真面目さん？", "face": "u1912a1"}, {"name": "エリアス", "text": "私は治癒士――ハイエロファントですから。", "face": "u373"}, {"name": "アヅミ", "text": "高位のヒーラーでございましたか。\nもしエリアスさんの力を受けていたのなら、\nその毒の治療も、叶ったことでしょうが。", "face": "u2024a1"}, {"name": "アヅミ", "text": "それにしても同じ食卓を囲いながら、\nどうして一人だけ……？", "face": "u2024a1"}, {"name": "パラベル", "text": "ほんとに苦しみなく逝けたのなら、\nせめて、せめて、それだけは救いですの。", "face": "u1922a1"}, {"name": "名探偵アナベラ", "text": "問題なのは――この中に、\nバルバストラフを殺した犯人が居るということだ。", "face": "u1309a1"}, {"name": "名探偵アナベラ", "text": "さて、助手くん。\n検死の間、君には調査を進めてもらっていたね。\nここで問おう――毒を入れることが可能だった人物は？", "face": "u1309a1"}, {"name": "助手王子", "text": "…………（ひそひそ）", "face": "u1"}, {"name": "名探偵アナベラ", "text": "なるほど――全員、か。", "face": "u1309a1"}, {"name": "名探偵アナベラ", "text": "つまり考えるべきは、\n『毒入り鍋を五人が食べて、一人だけ死んだのはなぜか』\nそして――『その状況を作れるのは、４人のうち誰か』。", "face": "u1309a1"}, {"name": "ノストラ", "text": "マーチャントのノストラよ。\n食材は私が切ったけど、それが何？", "face": "u1912a1"}, {"name": "アヅミ", "text": "料理人のアヅミでございます。\n食材の調達や調理は、大半をアヅミが行いました。", "face": "u2024a1"}, {"name": "パラベル", "text": "ガンスリンガーのパラベルですの。\n戦いのときに、配置を指示したのはベルですの。", "face": "u1922a1"}, {"name": "エリアス", "text": "ハイエロファントのエリアスです。\nお鍋をぴかぴかに洗いました。", "face": "u373"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "名探偵アナベラ", "text": "――この中に、殺人犯がいる。", "face": "u1309a1"}]}], "story_talk": true, "active": true}